"""
foamFV - Browse, search and generate OpenFOAM fvOptions entries.

The database is built by parsing the doxygen header comments
(Description / Usage / \\verbatim / \\table sections) of every class that is
registered as a finite-volume option (fv::option), plus the fvOptions files
found in the tutorials.

Sub-commands:
    build     Scan the sources and write the database
    list      List fvOptions (optionally by group)
    search    Full-text search in names and descriptions
    show      Show description, example, parameters and references
    example   Print real usage blocks taken from the tutorials
    add       Write a ready-to-edit entry into <case>/constant/fvOptions
    html      Generate the stand-alone catalog.html

Database lookup order:
    1. $FOAMFV_DB
    2. ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-~/.local/share}/foamFV/fvDatabase-<version>.json,
       where <version> is the basename of $WM_PROJECT_DIR (written by 'build')
    3. fvDatabase.json bundled next to this script
"""

